# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and in every working
# copy, so behaviour does not depend on the core.autocrlf setting of whichever
# machine cloned it. Without this, one contributor on CRLF can produce a diff
# that reports every line of a file as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles are generated; keep them out of diffs and merge conflicts.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated

# Never apply text conversion to binary content.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
